Modifications by Percona
------------------------

Percona modified the upstream work in 2026. The product was renamed from MariaDB
MaxScale to Percona Proxy for MariaDB throughout: the binaries, the libraries,
the packages, the configuration files and directories, the REST API and the
documentation. Packaging, migration and verification tooling was added under
BUILD/percona and script/. Compatibility with existing MariaDB MaxScale
installations was added, so that a MaxScale configuration file and a [maxscale]
section are still read, and a MaxScale configuration can be migrated. That
compatibility is why the MariaDB and MaxScale names still appear throughout the
source and the documentation.

